## 💬 CHAT APP

### **Models**

```python
from django.db import models
from django.conf import settings

class Conversation(models.Model):
    name = models.CharField(max_length=255, blank=True)
    participants = models.ManyToManyField(settings.AUTH_USER_MODEL, related_name='conversations')
    is_group = models.BooleanField(default=False)
    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)

    def __str__(self):
        return self.name or f"Chat {self.id}"

class Message(models.Model):
    conversation = models.ForeignKey(Conversation, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name='messages')
    sender = models.ForeignKey(settings.AUTH_USER_MODEL, on_delete=models.CASCADE)
    text = models.TextField(blank=True)
    file = models.FileField(upload_to='chat_files/', blank=True, null=True)
    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)
```

---

### **Schema Summary**

| Model        | Fields                                           | Relationships              |
| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |
| Conversation | id, name, participants, is_group, created_at     | M2M(User)                  |
| Message      | id, conversation, sender, text, file, created_at | FK(User), FK(Conversation) |

---

### **Endpoints**

| Method | Endpoint                       | Description              |
| ------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------------ |
| GET    | `/api/chats/`                  | List user conversations  |
| POST   | `/api/chats/`                  | Create new conversation  |
| GET    | `/api/chats/{id}/`             | Get conversation details |
| POST   | `/api/chats/{id}/messages/`    | Send message             |
| GET    | `/api/chats/{id}/messages/`    | List messages            |
| POST   | `/api/chats/{id}/add-user/`    | Add user to group        |
| POST   | `/api/chats/{id}/remove-user/` | Remove user from group   |

