## 🧩 Authentication

Use **JWT (SimpleJWT)** for token-based authentication.

```bash
pip install djangorestframework-simplejwt
```

### Endpoints:

| Method | Endpoint              | Description              |
| ------ | --------------------- | ------------------------ |
| POST   | `/api/token/`         | Get JWT access + refresh |
| POST   | `/api/token/refresh/` | Refresh access token     |

